  "ingredients": [
    "6 large beets, trimmed",
    "0.25 cup extra virgin olive oil",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 (8 ounce) package baby spinach leaves",
    "2 tomatoes, cut into bite-sized pieces",
    "2 avocados - peeled, pitted, and cut into bite-sized pieces",
    "0.5 red onion, chopped, or to taste",
    "1 (4 ounce) container crumbled feta cheese",
    "0.5 cup balsamic vinegar",
    "0.5 cup extra-virgin olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon Dijon mustard, or more to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TstubUSWAjNm4WNIYyhu31-DP2o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218179-my-favorite-beet-salad-VAT-step-01-706a5a9d32934d919c3f2bedf5a60f5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218179/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place beets in a large bowl; drizzle with 1/4 cup olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JZK3BsmyKJ0MqzmrXQ_awEmRmtA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218179-my-favorite-beet-salad-VAT-step-02-157b125a8ad74bc3a4c750874fcc7c16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218179/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay out 2 large squares of aluminum foil on a work surface, and place 3 beets onto the center of each sheet. Fold foil into packets, sealing beets inside. Place the packets into a baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jLhBWLsEihaXABZwfFocwIBBlLg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218179-my-favorite-beet-salad-VAT-step-03-9f13b84fb6d64656990ec5664bed12f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218179/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven and roast until tender when pierced with a fork, 1 to 1 ½ hours. Unwrap and let cool until easy to handle; peel and slice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WxVyCZHyA1qWvbpb0Lw8irj4I6c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218179-my-favorite-beet-salad-VAT-step-04-8b136e2159a44874b4a5ab5836ffa7ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218179/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange spinach leaves on a serving platter; sprinkle pieces of tomato and avocado over spinach and top with chopped red onion. Top with warm sliced beets and sprinkle with feta cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y0TzHtG3izXpx9aWT47XhA-hzBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218179-my-favorite-beet-salad-VAT-step-05-086dfeb4480740f6a8eb2c6436f92cd6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218179/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together balsamic vinegar, 1/2 cup olive oil, and Dijon mustard until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
